Upstream commit the port matches:
  0ac649541fca5b7a80bb724a308229fa4cfb2574   2026-11-09T22:18:40+01:00

How to port forward: diff the upstream files below against that commit (git diff 0ac6495..HEAD -- dll/ai/<file>)
and carry the changed decisions into the Lua module named. The port keeps the decisions (budgets, targets, timings,
the force's rules), not the engine patches: what upstream patches into the original exe (danger routes, honest
vision, the group move, the unload retries) is a C++ helper of this engine (docs/AI_LUA_UNITS.md §4, §11).

Per-file map (upstream dll/ai/<file> -> this folder). Each line says PORTED, PARTLY (what is missing), ENGINE (a
C++ helper of this engine stands in, nothing to port) or NOT STARTED.

  econ.c        PARTLY -> econ.lua (budget, workers, epoch), army.lua (choice). Ported: budget_reserve /
                spend_reserve (the epoch reserve; from farms only what the income cannot bring back),
                hook_add_resource (the military account and its income shares), econ_targets (the worker plan by
                shortfall and rate), gather_research, early_requirements, the copper plan's epoch attempt,
                substitute_soldier (the strongest affordable soldier), hoard caps. Missing: citizens_home (the
                engine's finders keep citizens on safe sites), train_budget's priority rows (priority.c).
  early.c       PARTLY -> econ.lua (towers), tactics.lua (bait). Ported: early_towers (two towers by the town
                centre: the front and the citizens' side), the builders, tower_bait (the citizens hit lead the
                raiders under the towers, epochs 1-2). Missing: early_militia (the engine's reflexes, ai.reflex,
                stand in).
  food.c        PORTED -> econ.lua (workers, claims): food_plan_needs (the citizens' food, the real wood need), the
                hunters, the patches (the engine's claims stand in for the site lists).
  mines.c       PORTED -> econ.lua (settlements): mine_drops / wood_drops (a settlement at the unworked mine or
